# design-kit/reference/live/*.html — frozen live-capture snapshots (inlined fonts/CSSOM),
# large and rarely diffed line by line. Routed through Git LFS instead of plain git so
# history doesn't carry every byte of every version forever. See PROGRESS.md item 44.
#
# Screenshots (screens/*.png, 1.6GB) are deliberately NOT included here — they stay
# gitignored/local to keep this under GitHub's free 1GB LFS quota. Only the HTML captures
# (783MB) are tracked; they're the actual measured ground truth this repo's tooling and
# design work depend on.
design-kit/reference/live/**/*.html filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
